title: One club is not one instruction
new-page: true

= The Left decides what “joining” means

New Left's **[+ nowa_lewica_seats +] seats** contain old barons, younger
progressive women and the remaining Spring network. Razem's **[+ razem_seats
+] deputies** have their own executive and will not treat a ministerial
photograph as a programme.

Only a cabinet that actually contains Lewica will grant the player government
authority. Voting confidence from outside does not.

