@annual_budget
title: The 2025 state budget
new-page: true
view-if: left_in_government = 1

= December 2024 — every promise gets a number

This is the coalition's annual survival test. The Left has **[+ budget +]
governing-capacity points** available because it holds cabinet responsibility.
These are not party campaign resources and they do not exist in opposition.

The package must first survive four Left caucuses, then KO, Poland 2050 and
PSL, then an ordinary Sejm vote. For final passage, abstentions do not count
against the bill; the budget needs more yes than no with quorum. Defeat is a
political crisis, not an automatic no-confidence vote.

- @budget_social_investment
- @budget_rural_care
- @budget_fiscal_brake
- @budget_fragmented

