<div class="ledger-row"><span>Razem · 7</span><b>[+ budget_razem_backing +]%</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Weighted mandate</span><b>[+ annual_budget_internal_backing +]%</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Caucus vetoes below 35%</span><b>[+ annual_budget_internal_vetoes +]</b></div></div>

An internal veto does not erase a minister's legal power. It tells the player
how many deputies will refuse to treat the cabinet text as their own.

- @budget_ratify_clean
- @budget_emergency_conference
- @budget_allow_rebels

