@budget_coalition_council
title: PSL puts the budget beside the exit
new-page: true
view-if: left_in_government = 1

= The coalition stage

KO's 157 seats contain fiscal hawks, local-government advocates, conservatives
and a liberal-left wing. Poland 2050's 33 contain Hołownia loyalists and
independent centrists. PSL's 32 arrive with a prepared statement threatening
to leave unless rural investment and cultural autonomy are protected.

The threat is credible because the government has 216 seats without PSL. It is
also tactical because abstention can still let a budget pass by ordinary
majority.

- @budget_psl_guarantee
- @budget_split_difference
- @budget_dare_psl
- @budget_ko_rewrite

@budget_psl_guarantee
title: Fund the rural guarantee and bind all 32 PSL deputies
subtitle: Spend 1 governing capacity. The clean majority; Razem calls it permanent ransom.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires cabinet participation and one remaining governing-capacity point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; annual_budget_ko_votes = 157; annual_budget_p2050_votes = 33; annual_budget_psl_votes = 32; annual_budget_psl_no = 0; annual_budget_psl_abstain = 0; psl_coalition_dissent -= 9; razem_dissent += 4; government_delivery += 3; coalition_budget_bargain = "Full rural guarantee"
go-to: budget_sejm_roll

@budget_split_difference
title: Give PSL local delivery but no new cultural veto
subtitle: Twenty-four PSL yes and eight abstentions.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: annual_budget_ko_votes = 157; annual_budget_p2050_votes = 33; annual_budget_psl_votes = 24; annual_budget_psl_no = 0; annual_budget_psl_abstain = 8; psl_coalition_dissent += 3; psl_relation -= 2; government_delivery += 2; coalition_budget_bargain = "Local delivery compromise"
go-to: budget_sejm_roll

@budget_dare_psl
title: Dare PSL to vote with PiS and Konfederacja
subtitle: If PSL dissent is high, all 32 vote no; otherwise they abstain.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_ko_votes = 157;
Q.annual_budget_p2050_votes = 33;
if (Q.psl_coalition_dissent >= 25) {
    Q.annual_budget_psl_votes = 0;
    Q.annual_budget_psl_no = 32;
    Q.annual_budget_psl_abstain = 0;
    Q.coalition_break_threat = 1;
} else {
    Q.annual_budget_psl_votes = 0;
    Q.annual_budget_psl_no = 0;
    Q.annual_budget_psl_abstain = 32;
}
Q.psl_coalition_dissent += 12;
Q.psl_relation -= 12;
Q.party_unity += 4;
Q.coalition_budget_bargain = "PSL challenged in the chamber";
Q.news_headline = "PSL is forced to choose between abstention and rupture";
!}
go-to: budget_sejm_roll

@budget_ko_rewrite
title: Accept KO's fiscal rewrite at the coalition council
subtitle: The centre closes ranks; Razem's seven deputies vote no.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_ko_votes = 157;
Q.annual_budget_p2050_votes = 33;
Q.annual_budget_psl_votes = 30;
Q.annual_budget_psl_no = 0;
Q.annual_budget_psl_abstain = 2;
const koRewriteDefectors = Math.min(7, Q.annual_budget_left_votes);
Q.annual_budget_left_no += koRewriteDefectors;
Q.annual_budget_left_votes =
    Math.max(0, Q.annual_budget_left_votes - koRewriteDefectors);
Q.ko_coalition_dissent -= 7;
Q.psl_coalition_dissent -= 4;
Q.razem_dissent += 18;
Q.labor_credibility -= 4;
Q.coalition_budget_bargain = "KO fiscal rewrite";
!}
go-to: budget_sejm_roll

@budget_sejm_roll
title: The annual budget vote
new-page: true
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_yes =
    Q.annual_budget_ko_votes + Q.annual_budget_p2050_votes +
    Q.annual_budget_psl_votes + Q.annual_budget_left_votes;
Q.annual_budget_no =
    212 + Q.annual_budget_psl_no + Q.annual_budget_left_no;
Q.annual_budget_abstain =
    Math.max(0, 157 - Q.annual_budget_ko_votes) +
    Math.max(0, 33 - Q.annual_budget_p2050_votes) +
    Math.max(
        0,
        32 - Q.annual_budget_psl_votes - Q.annual_budget_psl_no
    ) +
    Math.max(
        0,
        26 - Q.annual_budget_left_votes - Q.annual_budget_left_no
    );
Q.annual_budget_present =
    Q.annual_budget_yes + Q.annual_budget_no + Q.annual_budget_abstain;
Q.annual_budget_threshold = Q.annual_budget_no + 1;
Q.annual_budget_passed =
    Q.annual_budget_present >= Q.sejm_quorum_floor &&
    Q.annual_budget_yes > Q.annual_budget_no ? 1 : 0;
Q.annual_budget_done = 1;
if (Q.annual_budget_passed) {
    Q.news_headline = "The coalition passes its annual budget";
} else {
    Q.news_headline = "The annual budget is defeated";
}
!}

